      "description": "Online Payments - Wheeling University Apply Visit Deposit Give Transcripts Wheeling University Excellence in education and an unwavering commitment to student success. About Board of Trustees History Fast Facts Directions & Map Employment About the Area Social Media Title IX Public Safety Local Business Partnerships Consumer Information Strategic Plan Academics Office of the Registrar Summer of Purpose Undergraduate Programs Graduate Programs Professional Certificates Accelerated & Online Learning Experiential & Service Learning Honors, Research & Academic Conferences Moving You Forward Programs Student Success Center Admissions & Aid Undergraduate Graduate Programs Transfer Students International Students Parents & Family Accepted Student Checklist Test-Optional Policy Admissions Events Campus Visits Tuition & Fees Apply for Admission Financial Aid Veterans Student Life Living on Campus Dining on Campus Campus Ministry Student Involvement Student Support Services Student Handbook News Athletics Alumni Current Students Faculty & Staff Admissions Admissions Admissions & Aid Undergraduate Graduate Transfer Students International Students Parents & Family Accepted Student Checklist Test-Optional Policy Admissions Events Campus Visits Tuition & Fees Apply for Admission Financial Aid Student Accounts Net Price Calculator Scholarships & Grants Loans Tuition Payment Options Financial Aid Forms General Information Veterans Admissions Staff Student Accounts: studentaccounts@wju.edu 304-243-2222 Home » Admissions & Aid » Financial Aid » Student Accounts » Online Payments Online Payments Accepted students make your online tuition deposit* today! Pay Deposit Online Credit Card/E-Check Payments Payment by Visa, Mastercard, American Express, Discover, Diners Club, JCB, or Union will be accepted through Nelnet’s secure site which is linked above and below. There will be a 2.85% administrative fee on each transaction. It will take up to 14 days for this transaction to appear on the student’s account. Many students have requested e-check or savings account payments. The University is now offering this service through Nelnet. There is NO service fee to use a checking or savings account. It will take up to 14 days for this transaction to appear on the student’s account. As always, the Student Accounts Office will be more than willing to accept checks and cash payments. If you have questions, please contact the Student Accounts Office at 304-243-2222 . Connect to Nelnet for Online Credit Card / E-Check Payments Pursuing excellence. Greater expectations for others. Higher standards. Our Majors Find your home away from home. Explore WU 316 Washington Avenue Wheeling, WV 26003 304.243.2000 © Wheeling University, 2021 Apply Visit Deposit Give About Academics Admissions Student Life News Athletics Alumni Current Students Faculty & Staff Directions & Map Title IX Public Safety Policies Consumer Information Accreditation Status Employment Opportunities"
